  "body_text": "今年我们用不同的发酵桶在不同的温度条件下分别做了一些量产和实验批次\n// 普文蔓飞龙\n不锈钢桶\n（室外晒场\n+\n室外\n阴凉\n）\n塑胶桶（室外晒场）\n塑胶袋（室内）\nph\n：\n3.4\n-\n4.0\n// 澜沧宏丰\n塑胶桶（室外晒场）\nph：3.8-4.0\n//保山佐园\n不锈钢桶（室外\n晒场+\n室外阴凉）\n塑胶桶（室外市场+室内）\n塑胶袋（室外+室内）\nph：3.7 - 4.0\n下周陆续开始收样测试，公开杯测准备起来咯～\n部分素材如下：",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          今年我们用不同的发酵桶在不同的温度条件下分别做了一些量产和实验批次\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           // 普文蔓飞龙\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          不锈钢桶\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          （室外晒场\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          +\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          室外\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          阴凉\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ）\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          塑胶桶（室外晒场）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          塑胶袋（室内）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ph\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ：\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          3.4\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          -\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          4.0\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           // 澜沧宏丰\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          塑胶桶（室外晒场）\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ph：3.8-4.0\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           //保山佐园\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          不锈钢桶（室外\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          晒场+\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          室外阴凉）\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          塑胶桶（室外市场+室内）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          塑胶袋（室外+室内）\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ph：3.7 - 4.0\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          下周陆续开始收样测试，公开杯测准备起来咯～\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          部分素材如下：\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style